[00:23.82]Great God, Jehovah, you are deserving,
[00:31.48]Worthy of the highest praise,
[00:36.42]Good and just in all your ways.
[00:41.06]You have such power, deep love, and wisdom.
[00:49.70]You are God to endless days.
[01:17.74]Father, we feel your tender compassion.
[01:25.54]We are dust, and still you care;
[01:29.76]Graciously you hear our prayer.
[01:34.76]How you sustain us, teach us, and guide us!
[01:43.66]Help from you is always there.
[02:18.48]Heaven and earth now sing of your glory.
[02:25.90]Joyfully with voices raised,
[02:30.18]We exalt you all our days.
[02:35.08]Great God, Jehovah, you are deserving.
[02:43.92]Please accept our heartfelt praise.
